        "Description": "Nolan Cassidy has deployed an extensive undercover surveillance operation across Whittleton Creek, embedding agents throughout the town to observe its residents and protect Janus. \r\rYour assignment is to systematically dismantle Cassidy&apos;s entire operation, eliminating not only Janus but also Cassidy&apos;s main enforcer (&quot;The Hammer&quot;), his personal bodyguard, and his main undercover agents.\r\rOptional: No witnesses, No disguises, No recordings, Only kill the targets, and kill Janus via accident",
